OL,3,AExplosions heard in Ethiopia's capital
OL,4,Aafter drone flights banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FExplosions were heard overnight in
OL,7,FEthiopia's capital, some in the area of
OL,8,Fthe military headquarters in the west
OL,9,Fand another in the south of the city,
OL,10,Fresidents and diplomatic sources say.
OL,12,FThe blasts came hours after drone
OL,13,Fflights were banned over Addis Ababa
OL,14,Fand a week after fighting erupted in
OL,15,Fthe north between the army and a newly
OL,16,Flaunched alliance of armed groups
OL,17,Fincluding forces from the Tigray
OL,18,Fregion.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
