OL,3,AExplosions heard in Ethiopia's capital
OL,4,Aafter drone flights banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA source linked to the opposition
OL,7,Ffighters told the Reuters news agency
OL,8,Fthey were behind what they said were
OL,9,Fdrone strikes.
OL,11,F"It was very loud. It was strong enough
OL,12,Fto set off car alarms," a resident in a
OL,13,Fsouthern area of the city, near the
OL,14,Fbase of the secret service, told BBC
OL,15,FAmharic.
